&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://rankprompt.com/"&gt;Rank Prompt&lt;/a&gt; is an all-in-one AI search visibility platform covering the complete AEO loop: monitor, improve, and operate. Founded by marketing agency founders who built it as an internal tool before opening it to the public, the platform is now trusted by major brands like Mastercard, P&amp;amp;G, and 7-Eleven.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;It tracks six AI platforms (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Claude, Grok, and Google AI Mode) from a single dashboard.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Rank Prompt combines AI visibility monitoring with a highly actionable execution suite, including:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AEO Content Studio: &lt;/strong&gt;Generates 8 distinct types of SEO-optimized articles, including Comparison Articles and Ranked Lists, designed specifically to earn AI citations.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Citation Outreach: &lt;/strong&gt;Uses a proprietary Rank Prompt Score (RP Score) to analyze how “reachable” a citation source is, helping you target sites that actually accept contributor content (rather than wasting time pitching unreachable sites like Wikipedia).&lt;/li&gt; 
