 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Mode: &lt;/strong&gt;An AI-powered copilot that lives in a persistent dock, allowing you to ask visibility questions in plain English, edit drafts in a live canvas, and execute real platform actions.&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Both HubSpot AEO and Rank Prompt are purpose-built for AEO — not SEO tools trying to bolt on an AI module. This approach makes them meaningfully better at prompt-level tracking than traditional SEO platforms.&lt;/p&gt; 
